{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_1bba4a99a03a40919b6beca66d637935","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_05d8215d865e467a426d0800ac395d2ee6a65ddabc98a0c34fe34a4945c88f1f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"context-labs/halo@b7f8509745d6 snapshot 9f2700ac05de7f87","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4be8636be3232fc0d1faeefb9cd4b6df95d6bf62c8742679d84c9927250d9834"],"source_ids":["src_c9bd916485bb51fda92100fc22bbece4"],"text":"HALO uses OPENAI_API_KEY and OPENAI_BASE_URL; if the base URL is unset it defaults to https://api.openai.com/v1, and CLI settings mirror the SDK's ModelConfig and ModelProviderConfig.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1bba4a99a03a40919b6beca66d637935"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_1bba4a99a03a40919b6beca66d637935","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_0b29ad6fd633ae791ef5d8d0edf63959f0b5278dcf6cf56dcb2b34701f66da7b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"context-labs/halo@b7f8509745d6 snapshot 9f2700ac05de7f87","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_816d8aedfdedda0287d7e442b768a1010b7956cf6b3cfc729cb8e75d9936bc13","slc_eaa944fb10fcc396dd0e97a5a6804693361516e9d09214dc1fe1145969c5b6c9","slc_ef71de5cc7156ee9c543d5cda8aebb990dd67ff50969ce96a4c472103acd6c93"],"source_ids":["src_c9bd916485bb51fda92100fc22bbece4"],"text":"Repository development practice: local development uses uv and go-task; task env:setup installs uv, syncs the venv from uv.lock, and configures git hooks, with tasks for pre-commit checks, unit tests, and integration tests.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1bba4a99a03a40919b6beca66d637935"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_1bba4a99a03a40919b6beca66d637935","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_0c59b8f0b1df3804d825264dd20858df9ce3e9d132caea80644c1baf5ed829c4","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"context-labs/halo@b7f8509745d6 snapshot 9f2700ac05de7f87","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_78bd7a115b64a661ccba387aa209e9147513b9efd4ee962048dae018ec3adabe","slc_ae066871e92eb41c31b20203fcaba3a848fee4c69184b9df77cdc470d0fc72ab","slc_c6cfb88390989a8d61ff2ff504fbdf4bfe491eea21dcb2fb4503b5f4fca4d043"],"source_ids":["src_c9bd916485bb51fda92100fc22bbece4"],"text":"The project ships a HALO Desktop App for local use, a Python package (halo-engine on PyPI) implementing the core HALO-RLM engine, and a demo project showing HALO loops with the OpenAI Agents SDK.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1bba4a99a03a40919b6beca66d637935"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_1bba4a99a03a40919b6beca66d637935","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_13a6fe5ae0fec041c39ce21da4e5b3bb1b56ca137bb945c283ae26efdab0c8b0","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"context-labs/halo@b7f8509745d6 snapshot 9f2700ac05de7f87","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_465c91b6fdf08bb1c74a1c3bcb21ea3b88c51145ea832e0851bff6a54a895a50","slc_852e06826554e9c380e857aa63bbe07bf7c04ddb77f0e36b7df788dc2d18ea91","slc_9f5968bda49dd7b9d5a1cc9987f5ad10b0ba8f8fd9974c0cb5c57741dd3e1966"],"source_ids":["src_c9bd916485bb51fda92100fc22bbece4"],"text":"The CLI takes a required JSONL trace path and prompt, with flags like --model (default gpt-5.4-mini) and --synthesis-model for trace summarization, and supports --base-url and custom headers as shown in an OpenRouter example.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1bba4a99a03a40919b6beca66d637935"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_1bba4a99a03a40919b6beca66d637935","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_198a146ae41ab9d1b32ff045c8bf5804e594ccad82fef1ca108b482751b10c3e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"context-labs/halo@b7f8509745d6 snapshot 9f2700ac05de7f87","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_338b9cee0436d03042e98acc3b51983f9922d588b9de7b2e3bb38cb9ccde9f5d","slc_36e736e4b88835ff86e0dddc85bc96a664a32696b4c97ba34d547665d2cac4bf","slc_8d3eb580c32caf90ebb7f32df9cfd8172190c33d66b97d049540c7a12465dc76","slc_e0c3d534866f364d665bede0f58604ee709937bad5efdc536727232d52ee1957"],"source_ids":["src_aaee50048e1d5762bc2580c2b7829062"],"text":"The integration writes one JSONL span per line with OTLP identity fields, resource/scope blocks, and inference.* projection attributes (project_id, observation_kind, token counts, tool/agent attributes) that the Engine indexes on, filtering on inference.project_id.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1bba4a99a03a40919b6beca66d637935"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_1bba4a99a03a40919b6beca66d637935","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1f2479b10825892ed072c522fdd035ab32d873b95f6858e675277628f62e7570","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"context-labs/halo@b7f8509745d6 snapshot 9f2700ac05de7f87","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_331ef6906b987e6264a41d0365d78999be54b4591d1794399c8f86c779edbaea","slc_7dde18b79f4e5fe19bc5480a7dab2ace27084f30d5877c3ca972dd66f47374ee"],"source_ids":["src_c9bd916485bb51fda92100fc22bbece4"],"text":"HALO's own telemetry is off by default; passing --telemetry emits OpenInference-shaped traces, uploaded over OTLP to inference.net when INFERENCE_API_KEY is set, otherwise written to a local JSONL file.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1bba4a99a03a40919b6beca66d637935"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_1bba4a99a03a40919b6beca66d637935","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6921439416cf368d91e329598a3d02a70295ef10e309770768eebd65384d5f7a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"context-labs/halo@b7f8509745d6 snapshot 9f2700ac05de7f87","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_690a29d72be702b02a4d96a20fbb2091119abcd90d4429c61aeedb009fc04363","slc_c6cfb88390989a8d61ff2ff504fbdf4bfe491eea21dcb2fb4503b5f4fca4d043"],"source_ids":["src_c9bd916485bb51fda92100fc22bbece4"],"text":"HALO is described as a methodology for building recursively self-improving agent harnesses using RLMs, with the repo containing a desktop app, methodology docs, a Python engine package, and demos.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1bba4a99a03a40919b6beca66d637935"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_1bba4a99a03a40919b6beca66d637935","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_71b5236595fb74ee0a762d5c5f921f39791c7ad91c404752097a678aeac7edf3","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=evaluation","setting":"context-labs/halo@b7f8509745d6 snapshot 9f2700ac05de7f87","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0fba5c8779fd6898b7182631e221730ffc8c641408269b62bad24b96c6770e79","slc_3149e489b9cc6db1ed0a572ade48ac90ba68052108c1dbb6786219e5e7f3b73e"],"source_ids":["src_c9bd916485bb51fda92100fc22bbece4"],"text":"On AppWorld, harness-only optimization reportedly raised SGC: Gemini 3 Flash dev 36.8%→52.6% and test_normal 37.5%→48.2%; Sonnet 4.6 dev 73.7%→89.5% and test_normal 62.5%→73.2%, iterating on dev and checking test_normal for overfitting.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1bba4a99a03a40919b6beca66d637935"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_1bba4a99a03a40919b6beca66d637935","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7df3a5dbdf9586bcc6b93014c53bdce9205c527e0f92a5f6efce6638c00bbef7","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"context-labs/halo@b7f8509745d6 snapshot 9f2700ac05de7f87","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_e7561cd440080af4f6001e46fbe883943c916d19638720413360b1d3d9bcaca8"],"source_ids":["src_c9bd916485bb51fda92100fc22bbece4"],"text":"The HALO loop: collect OpenTelemetry-compatible traces from an agent harness, feed them to the HALO-RLM engine, which decomposes traces into common failure modes and produces a report that a coding agent turns into harness changes, then the cycle repeats.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1bba4a99a03a40919b6beca66d637935"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_1bba4a99a03a40919b6beca66d637935","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_938980f911fb84af243f7cd646c194a223807ef28a246a2acad88b54d40351c2","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"context-labs/halo@b7f8509745d6 snapshot 9f2700ac05de7f87","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_6fe0f092ce971fed7d9a60e1e8b1cdba702e0c14ba3fc9b0ca8dd709ed9025a6","slc_87635b9c8e6f26ae2a9edbbefbbc18d424e10e4577001a01601214373748093c"],"source_ids":["src_c9bd916485bb51fda92100fc22bbece4"],"text":"The engine exposes multiple entry points from engine.main (e.g. stream_engine_async, run_engine_async, stream_engine_output) yielding AgentOutputItem and AgentTextDelta types, trading off streaming observability versus simplicity.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1bba4a99a03a40919b6beca66d637935"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_1bba4a99a03a40919b6beca66d637935","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d539bc03b6fc4b52f2c80abc382ed3c484755af10320f5dce1a14a17e618e5f6","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"context-labs/halo@b7f8509745d6 snapshot 9f2700ac05de7f87","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3e918f3e635780a77fec78f642d2c2b8ef81d4a97355bbb1e469bfb62ba52509"],"source_ids":["src_c9bd916485bb51fda92100fc22bbece4"],"text":"The authors argue general harnesses like Claude Code overfit to errors in single traces when analyzing long traces, motivating a specialized RLM for systemic trace analysis.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1bba4a99a03a40919b6beca66d637935"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_1bba4a99a03a40919b6beca66d637935","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_fd62ac594fe5a1a08da02d6eb1ad53b140e96b4eef647e2b80f4154b61b0bbd8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"context-labs/halo@b7f8509745d6 snapshot 9f2700ac05de7f87","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_165f98f1b65110f84c59040cb77317e475c295ee7e61f029f1b98d792ca45077","slc_6d0569289f5a9f0a4920443ca53d76807b1e675eeaa14b3f2177786b6939ebad"],"source_ids":["src_aaee50048e1d5762bc2580c2b7829062"],"text":"The OpenAI Agents SDK integration's tracing.py is a self-contained ~450-line module using only stdlib plus openai-agents, with no OpenTelemetry packages, exporter, collector, or instrumentor required.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:42:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1bba4a99a03a40919b6beca66d637935"}
